## Decisions Made

- **shotId: normalize at the single door, not tolerant lookup** — short = display only (shortShotLabel), long = identity; convert once at `/api/episodes/[id]/trigger`. Keeps lookup strict so typos fail loud.
- **Act count is script-owned, never hardcoded** — `countScriptActs` + triple invariant (act-objects == max A# in shot_ids == script acts) HALTs drift at generation. E11 was the first 4-act episode, which is why numbering «never broke before».
- **0.5s deleted shot excluded from BOTH gates via one shared `isDeletedShot`** — kills the Director «approve the deleted shot» cheat; magic 0.5 centralized in `DELETED_SHOT_MAX_SECONDS`.
- **Stop hand-editing master; work in worktrees** — master = stable integration branch the live servers/Polина run against; orchestrator ON master is correct (it's the merge-owner), the anti-pattern was direct code edits on master in a rush. Worktrees live in `.claude/worktrees/`.
- **E11 board act-grouping fix deferred to after finale (q8b)** — shot_ids correct, render unaffected; cosmetic act-object split done later.

